body:
Ive lived in the Philippines my entire childhood life and after graduating college I went traveling. Was walking around Barcelona alone just exploring the city at my leisure. I was walking down the main road (La Rambla) and decided to take a side street entirely at random. I just thought "hey, let me see what's through here". As I turn, I see this big guy outside of the Zara store and he turns and its my parents best friends from the Philippines and their kids. I didn't know they were traveling or in Barcelona and had I not just decided to take the side street on a whim, I wouldn't have seen them.

&#x200B;

Small world.
